### 2.1 Borehole Washout Flagging & Environmental Conditioning Criteria

* **Bad-Hole Flagging Criteria (`BADHOLE`):** Caliper washout $> {{ qaqc_params.caliper_limit }}\text{ in}$ above bit size (`{{ qaqc_params.bitsize_in }}\text{ in}`), density pad-standoff correction $\Delta\rho > {{ qaqc_params.drho_limit }}\text{ g/cc}$, or rugose bulk density $\rho_b < {{ qaqc_params.rhob_min }}\text{ g/cc}$.
* **Bad-Hole Mitigation Mode:** `{{ qaqc_params.badhole_treatment }}` (automatic fallback in rugose washouts to prevent optimistic density-porosity spikes).
* **Light-Hydrocarbon Invasion Correction:** Gaymard-Poupon neutron-density response correction applied where $\rho_{hc} = {{ qaqc_params.rho_hc }}\text{ g/cc}$ and $HI_{hc} = {{ qaqc_params.hi_hc }}$.

